  "Jellyfish Reverie Lv.$1": "",
  "Jellyfish Reverie <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, with a $2 base chance to inflict <link=\"s|103\"><u>Freeze</u></link> for $3 turns. Restore $4 SP to Miyu (this effect is affected by SP Recovery), SP restored by this can exceed the SP cap (up to SP equal to the SP cap).\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>From the depths of fairy tales, jellyfish drift gently, unfolding translucent umbrellas that emit a soft glow, until the next moment, when the light erupts and the waters shatter, dealing Ice damage to foes.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Cerulean Concerto Lv.$1": "",
  "Cerulean Concerto <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. When <link=\"s|249\"><u>[Ocean's Domain]</u></link> is active, each <link=\"s|251\"><u>[Thousandfold Waves]</u></link> stacks increase skill damage by $2. After using this skill, exit <link=\"s|249\"><u>[Ocean's Domain]</u></link> and lose all <link=\"s|251\"><u>[Thousandfold Waves]</u></link> stacks. This counts as a <link=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link>.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Silvery scales glint as a school of fish darts through shimmering light. Then, in an instant, surges like tidal waves through enemy ranks, leaving lethal ripples in their wake.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Lightwave Leap Lv.$1": "",
  "Lightwave Leap <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Get on the surfboard, immediately cleanse Miyu's Mental Ailment and open <link=\"s|249\"><u>[Ocean's Domain]</u></link>: Gain Null Down and Null Mental/Control Ailment, Miyu cannot use Melee Attack, Gun Attack, and Item; When gaining any effect, extend its duration by $1 turn; When an ally end their turn, automatically use [Tidal Surge] if Miyu has enough SP.\\n[Tidal Surge]: Spend $2 SP to deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK. Gain $4 [Thousandfold Waves] stack, each [Thousandfold Waves] stack increases [Tidal Surge] skill damage by $5 and SP cost by $6. Stacks up to $7 times. This counts as a <link=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link>. Damage from this Follow Up cannot deal Down Point damage.\\nUse this skill again to exit [Ocean's Domain] then lose all [Thousandfold Waves]. Miyu can still use other skills this turn but cannot open [Ocean's Domain].\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>\"Let's go!\" Lifted by dolphins, the girl bursts forth like a spirit riding the fairytale waves, splashing crystalline droplets as the surf transforms into a raging torrent, swallowing enemies whole.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. If <link=\"s|249\"><u>[Ocean's Domain]</u></link> is active, deal bonus Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Ice damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal light Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "During battle, increase Miyu's ATK based on her SP Recovery, up to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK at <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> SP Recovery.": "",
  "During battle, increase Miyu's ATK based on her SP Recovery, up to <color=#0169ca>$2</color> ATK at <color=#0169ca>$1</color> SP Recovery.": "",
  "When [Ocean's Domain] is active, increase DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>.": "",
  "When [Ocean's Domain] is active, increase DMG Dealt by <color=#0169ca>$1</color>.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>[Ocean's Domain]</color>": "",
  "{{A}} will open [Ocean's Domain] when using [Lightwave Leap]. When [Ocean's Domain] is active, {{A}} will gain the following effects:\\n1. Gain Null Down and Null Mental/Control Ailment, Miyu cannot use Melee Attack, Gun Attack, and Item;\\n2. When gaining any effect, extend the duration by $1 turn;\\n3. When an ally end their turn, automatically use [Tidal Surge] if Miyu has enough SP.\\n[Tidal Surge]: Spend SP to deal Ice damage to all foes. Gain $2 [Thousandfold Waves] stack, each [Thousandfold Waves] stack increases [Tidal Surge] skill damage and SP cost. Can stack.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>[Tidal Surge]</color>": "",
  "Tidal Surge": "",
  "When [Ocean's Domain] is active and an ally end their turn, automatically use [Tidal Surge] if Miyu has enough SP. Spend SP to deal Ice damage to all foes. Gain $1 [Thousandfold Waves] stack, each [Thousandfold Waves] stack increases [Tidal Surge] skill damage and SP cost. Can stack.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>[Thousandfold Waves]</color>": "",
  "{{A}}'s special resource. When [Ocean's Domain] is active, gain $1 [Thousandfold Waves] stack when using [Tidal Surge].\\nEach [Thousandfold Waves] stack increases [Cerulean Concerto] and [Tidal Surge] skill damage and [Tidal Surge] SP cost. Can stack.": "",
  "Call of the Tide": "",
  "During battle, {{A}} can get on her surfboard to open <link=\"s|249\"><u>[Ocean's Domain]</u></link>, spending SP to keep dealing damage to foes. Increase {{A}}'s Max SP to $1. At the start of battle, set her SP to $2. At the start of each other ally's action, {{A}} will restore $3 SP (this effect is affected by SP Recovery). \\n{{A}} will gain the following buffs based on the SP she restored (including SP over the cap):\\nRestored $4 SP: Increase ATK by $5;\\nRestored $6 SP: Increase DMG Dealt by $7;\\nRestored $8 SP: Increase Crit Rate by $9;\\nRestored $10 SP: Increase Crit DMG by $11.": "",
  "Girl from the Sea": "",
  "Decrease the SP cost of <link=\"s|250\"><u>[Tidal Surge]</u></link> by $1. Increase the maximum number of <link=\"s|251\"><u>[Thousandfold Waves]</u></link> stacks by $2.\\nWhen Summer Miyu Sahara opens <link=\"s|249\"><u>[Ocean's Domain]</u></link>, immediately extend all her effect duration by $3 turn.": "",
  "Gazing at Sunset": "",
  "When <link=\"s|249\"><u>[Ocean's Domain]</u></link> is active, increase {{A}}'s Crit DMG by $1. \\nAfter using <link=\"s|250\"><u>[Tidal Surge]</u></link> $2 times, {{A}} will use $3 special <link=\"s|250\"><u>[Tidal Surge]</u></link>. This <link=\"s|250\"><u>[Tidal Surge]</u></link> does not cost SP and grant <link=\"s|251\"><u>[Thousandfold Waves]</u></link>.": "",
  "To Reach That Light": "",
  "Silent Vigil": "",
  "HIGHLIGHT Enchanced: Increase Summer Miyu Sahara's Follow Up DMG by $1 for $2 turns.": "",
  "Dissolve into the Tides": "",
  "That Azure Dream": "",
  "Increase {{A}}'s Max SP by $1. At the start of battle, fully restore SP then automatically open <link=\"s|249\"><u>[Ocean's Domain]</u></link>. Increase the maximum number of <link=\"s|251\"><u>[Thousandfold Waves]</u></link> stacks by $2.\\nIncrease the SP restored by [Jellyfish Reverie] by $3.\\nSummer Miyu Sahara will not exit <link=\"s|249\"><u>[Ocean's Domain]</u></link> when using [Cerulean Concerto]. Change the timing of <link=\"s|251\"><u>[Thousandfold Waves]</u></link> stack loss to the end of turn, fully restore SP after losing all stacks.": "",
  "Deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, with a $2 base chance to inflict <link=\"s|103\"><u>Freeze</u></link> for $3 turns. Restore $4 SP to Miyu (this effect is affected by SP Recovery), SP restored by this can exceed the SP cap (up to SP equal to the SP cap).": "",
  "Deal Ice damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to $1 of ATK, with a $2 base chance to inflict Freeze for $3 turns. Restore $4 SP to Miyu (this effect is affected by SP Recovery), SP restored by this can exceed the SP cap (up to SP equal to the SP cap).": "",
  "Deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. When <link=\"s|249\"><u>[Ocean's Domain]</u></link> is active, each <link=\"s|251\"><u>[Thousandfold Waves]</u></link> stacks increase skill damage by $2. After using this skill, exit <link=\"s|249\"><u>[Ocean's Domain]</u></link> and lose all <link=\"s|251\"><u>[Thousandfold Waves]</u></link> stacks. This counts as a <link=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link>.": "",
  "Deal Ice damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to $1 of ATK. When [Ocean's Domain] is active, each [Thousandfold Waves] stacks increase skill damage by $2. After using this skill, exit [Ocean's Domain] and lose all [Thousandfold Waves] stacks. This counts as a Follow Up.": "",
  "\"Get on the surfboard, immediately cleanse Miyu's Mental Ailment and open <link=\"s|249\"><u>[Ocean's Domain]</u></link>: Gain Null Down and Null Mental/Control Ailment, Miyu cannot use Melee Attack, Gun Attack, and Item; When gaining any effect, extend its duration by $1 turn; When an ally end their turn, automatically use [Tidal Surge] if Miyu has enough SP.\\n[Tidal Surge]: Spend $2 SP to deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK. Gain $4 [Thousandfold Waves] stack, each [Thousandfold Waves] stack increases [Tidal Surge] skill damage by $5 and SP cost by $6. Stacks up to $7 times. This counts as a <link=\"s|100\"><u>Follow Up</u></link>. Damage from this Follow Up cannot deal Down Point damage.\\nUse this skill again to exit [Ocean's Domain] then lose all [Thousandfold Waves]. Miyu can still use other skills this turn but cannot open [Ocean's Domain].": "",
  "Get on the surfboard, immediately cleanse Miyu's Mental Ailment and open [Ocean's Domain]: Gain Null Down and Null Mental/Control Ailment, Miyu cannot use Melee Attack, Gun Attack, and Item; When gaining any effect, extend its duration by $1 turn; When an ally end their turn, automatically use [Tidal Surge] if Miyu has enough SP.\\n[Tidal Surge]: Spend $2 SP to deal Ice damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to $3 of ATK. Gain $4 [Thousandfold Waves] stack, each [Thousandfold Waves] stack increases [Tidal Surge] skill damage by $5 and SP cost by $6. Stacks up to $7 times. This counts as a Follow Up. Damage from this Follow Up cannot deal Down Point damage.": "",
  "Deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. If <link=\"s|249\"><u>[Ocean's Domain]</u></link> is active, deal bonus Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK.": "",
  "Deal Ice damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to $1 of ATK. If [Ocean's Domain] is active, deal bonus Ice damage to all foes equal to $2 of ATK.": "",
